# endon.sm -- A part with a cut edge seen nearly end on from the top
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# From the fuzzer (0031): the edge of 8 mm of the three-cornered cut
# runs along the view but for 1 micrometer, and smview wrote that
# micrometer as a line, which rounding made shorter than SLIVER.
sheet 2.286 2.0317 0.4242
plate base -6.1703 48.0297 22.4849 125.7529 at 5.6714 0 78.4825 axes +y +z
flange f0 base -y -90 17.6735 span 1.4803 18.3995
flange f2 base +x 60.2026 24.4008 span 46.651 135.4512
cut cut1 12.3582 129.3614 2.804 136.7858 along x from 2.4246 to 6.6322
outline outline1 along x from 2.47525 to 6.58155
point 7.8429 178.8323
point 7.3138 182.2485
point 7.3128 174.2948
outline outline2 along z from 121.85665 to 124.81835
point -12.2258 7.2245
point -7.6194 7.2245 arc -9.9226 7.2245 cw
